OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 20 FEB
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Rachmaninov
OL,5,     GRachmaninov's final years are
OL,6,     Gspent on American Soil - in
OL,7,     GHollywood - sheltering from the
OL,8,     Gwar in Europe.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined by
OL,11,     GDowland's Foundry - performing
OL,12,     Glive to mark the 400th
OL,13,     Ganniversary of Dowland's death.
OL,14,     GGeorgia Shackleton is also live
OL,15,     Gin studio with Aaren Bennett.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,19,     Gfrom Caroline Shaw, Florence
OL,20,     GPrice, George Dyson and
OL,21,     GTchaikovsky.
